fixture tech12_dash_from_wax_cling_without_kindle_goes_away
doc Control for tech12_kindle_dash_from_wax_cling_burns_through: without the Kindle Votive wax is a wall like any other, and a dash from a cling with the stick toward it goes away from it (docs/adr/0010, the wall).
room test/wax
